{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "经过一天的休息，终于迎来了考试成绩公布的日子。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一大早就跟着大家一起去看了张贴出来的排名——", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "一大早就跟着大家一起去看了张贴出来的排名——", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～啊啊～啊～……啊～……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0226", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「………」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回到教室的时候我听到了奇怪的声音。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是应该打开这扇门呢，还是应该就这样离开呢……", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～诶～哇～真的～哇～啊啊就是那里……啊～」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0227", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～安洁也很幸福～\\n　您能这么高兴我也很开心～～」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "「啊～安洁也很幸福～　您能这么高兴我也很开心～～」", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0718", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，还是打开吧。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走进教室，安洁正在给大家按摩肩膀。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学首先被选为了她的目标，从刚才开始就发出如痴如醉的叫声。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": "乾同学首先被选为了她的目标，从刚才开始就发出如痴如醉的叫声。", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到这样的光景，感觉考试结果什么的都已经无所谓了。\\n（背景音：呵啊～不错，真不错……啊对，那里那里，啊～）", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "看到这样的光景，感觉考试结果什么的都已经无所谓了。（背景音：呵啊～不错，真不错……啊对，那里那里，啊～）", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 54, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下来是樱乃同学～」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0719", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……嗯，安洁，好厉害，嗯」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0680", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽同学也来试试吧」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0720", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯哼，嗯，菜菜好熟练……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0325", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最后是压台戏爱理同学～」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0721", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、啊、那里不行……嗯……\\n　力道再，嗯，轻一点，嗯……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「啊、啊、那里不行……嗯……　力道再，嗯，轻一点，嗯……」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯、嗯、啊啊、就是这……这里、好舒服……\\n　啊啊……嗯……嗯……」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "「嗯、嗯、嗯、啊啊、就是这……这里、好舒服……　啊啊……嗯……嗯……」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理按摩时间太长了吧？」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0228", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟爱理同学是年级第一呢～」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0722", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，原来和这个有关系啊……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，因为大伙有在濑名同学家一起学习， 所以全员都取得了预想之外的好成绩。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "顺带一提，因为大伙有在濑名同学家一起学习， 所以全员都取得了预想之外的好成绩。", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学也一如既往地拿下了学年第一。刚刚安洁的按摩也是对她的奖励。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "濑名同学也一如既往地拿下了学年第一。刚刚安洁的按摩也是对她的奖励。", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这次的按摩只限于女生哦，还请谅解～」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "「这次的按摩只限于女生哦，还请谅解～」", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0723", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我倒是无所谓……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然光在旁边看就有种心跳加速的感觉……", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太这家伙看完成绩就不知道跑哪去了，托他的福这幅光景让我一个人独占了～……", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "隼太这家伙看完成绩就不知道跑哪去了，托他的福这幅光景让我一个人独占了～……", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是我现在的想法。安洁继续按摩着肩膀。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理同学，看招看招～」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0724", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊啊……！」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理好像很舒服的感觉……」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0681", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近总感觉肩膀有些僵硬……啊啊……\\n　有、有认真学习真是太好了……！」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「最近总感觉肩膀有些僵硬……啊啊……　有、有认真学习真是太好了……！」", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～呜溜～」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0098", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么啦小熊喵？你也想按摩吗？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0326", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么就♪」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0327", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～呜溜……溜～呜溜溜溜～……」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0099", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是这里不舒服吗？这里怎么样～」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0725", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯啊啊就是那……嗯……嗯啊……」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜……呜溜～呜……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0100", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她们开始分工合作相互按摩起来，感觉真的把考试结果之类的事情都抛在脑后了。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "她们开始分工合作相互按摩起来，感觉真的把考试结果之类的事情都抛在脑后了。", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
