{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。前些日子，\\n　稍微给安洁按摩了一下肩膀」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": "「嗯。前些日子，　稍微给安洁按摩了一下肩膀」", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为之前新吾同学给我按摩了肩膀，所以我今天也想趁着这个机会给大家按摩一下」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "「因为之前新吾同学给我按摩了肩膀，所以我今天也想趁着这个机会给大家按摩一下」", "plain_idx": 409, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0732", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然～后～呢……呵呵呵～纱纱真是的……♪」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0733", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
