{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别说得那么暧昧啊，安洁！\\n　真是的，被瓜生这混蛋上了算了～！」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": "「别说得那么暧昧啊，安洁！　真是的，被瓜生这混蛋上了算了～！」", "plain_idx": 416, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0234", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不对啊，现在冷静地想想，“我揉了安洁的肩膀”这句话就十分让人在意了。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": "……不对啊，现在冷静地想想，“我揉了安洁的肩膀”这句话就十分让人在意了。", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还好我开了个玩笑，把对我不利的话题都丢给别人了。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": "还好我开了个玩笑，把对我不利的话题都丢给别人了。", "plain_idx": 419, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再怎么说我也在这种环境下生活一个月了，我已经逐渐习惯了处理那样的情况……」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": "「再怎么说我也在这种环境下生活一个月了，我已经逐渐习惯了处理那样的情况……」", "plain_idx": 420, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是可怕」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0687", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们兄妹相视点头。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，我和樱乃向楼门口走去。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
