{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，因为我看安洁那么努力」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是说，我给安洁按摩肩膀让她太开心了，所以也想给大家按摩一下……", "text_idx": 428, "plain": "也就是说，我给安洁按摩肩膀让她太开心了，所以也想给大家按摩一下……", "plain_idx": 428, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我作为整件事的开端，总感觉有点小开心。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊……」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0689", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
