{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉如果不这么说，会有点不妥，于是我尽可能轻描淡写地提出了这个建议。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": "感觉如果不这么说，会有点不妥，于是我尽可能轻描淡写地提出了这个建议。", "plain_idx": 433, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来啊我也」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「务必」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0690", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃听到后立刻点点头。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜欢哥哥给我揉肩。安洁被哥哥搞得神魂颠倒也确实是没办法的」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": "「喜欢哥哥给我揉肩。安洁被哥哥搞得神魂颠倒也确实是没办法的」", "plain_idx": 438, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0691", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你说的那个安洁可是把大家都变得神魂颠倒的了……」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁和哥哥不一样。\\n　回去之后，要让我神魂颠倒哦」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": "「安洁和哥哥不一样。　回去之后，要让我神魂颠倒哦」", "plain_idx": 442, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0692", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是～是」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和樱乃所说的“哥哥”这个称呼一样，两个人独处的时候还好，在大家面前的话，感觉比起安洁的暴言更能让场面热闹起来。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": "和樱乃所说的“哥哥”这个称呼一样，两个人独处的时候还好，在大家面前的话，感觉比起安洁的暴言更能让场面热闹起来。", "plain_idx": 445, "len": 55, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那快点回去」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0693", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的是啊，直接回去吗」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跑着回去」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0694", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样就没有足够的体力到家了吧……哎啊」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0695", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事，有垃圾」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有张皱巴巴的纸在地上，总之先捡了起来。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": "有张皱巴巴的纸在地上，总之先捡了起来。", "plain_idx": 455, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜啊？！」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0734", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我顺着声音的方向看去，安洁站在走廊对面。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她抓着裙摆跑了过来。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被抢先一步了～明明在看到你们两个的同时\\n　我也注意到地上有垃圾了～」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": "「被抢先一步了～明明在看到你们两个的同时　我也注意到地上有垃圾了～」", "plain_idx": 462, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0735", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁很想捡吗？」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0696", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然是的，一直捡垃圾，\\n　把学校变得干净整洁，这就是我可以骄傲的地方」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": "「当然是的，一直捡垃圾，　把学校变得干净整洁，这就是我可以骄傲的地方」", "plain_idx": 467, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0736", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这份骄傲，肯定在默默支撑着学校环境的美化工作吧。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": "这份骄傲，肯定在默默支撑着学校环境的美化工作吧。", "plain_idx": 469, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结女这么干净，确实光靠值日生是做不到的。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": "结女这么干净，确实光靠值日生是做不到的。", "plain_idx": 470, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是这次被新吾同学抢先了一步。哈哈，安洁真是没面子啊」", "text_idx": 471, "plain": "「但是这次被新吾同学抢先了一步。哈哈，安洁真是没面子啊」", "plain_idx": 471, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0737", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～那就……」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接球！」", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我嘿的一声把垃圾像火山喷发一样扔了出去。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「汪汪！」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0738", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁轻轻地转了一圈，华丽的接球！", "text_idx": 478, "plain": "安洁轻轻地转了一圈，华丽的接球！", "plain_idx": 478, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「然后立刻回传！」", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0739", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好球」", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可以扔垃圾玩的啊～」", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0740", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，彼此彼此。\\n　那就请安洁帮我扔到垃圾箱吧」", "text_idx": 484, "plain": "「啊哈哈，彼此彼此。　那就请安洁帮我扔到垃圾箱吧」", "plain_idx": 485, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「了解了！诶嘿嘿，那么请慢走～」", "text_idx": 486, "plain": "「了解了！诶嘿嘿，那么请慢走～」", "plain_idx": 486, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0741", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最终安洁接过我手上的垃圾，可爱地鞠了一躬就离开了。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": "最终安洁接过我手上的垃圾，可爱地鞠了一躬就离开了。", "plain_idx": 488, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我们也回去吧。当然不是跑回去，是走回去」", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0697", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃一直歪着头盯着我。", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真少见」", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0698", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁？」", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0699", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能是因为安洁刚才在旁边，她对我的称呼从“哥哥”又变回了“哥”。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": "可能是因为安洁刚才在旁边，她对我的称呼从“哥哥”又变回了“哥”。", "plain_idx": 497, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样子和女孩子胡闹」", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0700", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……是这样吗。\\n　我认为这算是开玩笑一类的」", "text_idx": 500, "plain": "「嗯……是这样吗。　我认为这算是开玩笑一类的」", "plain_idx": 501, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是没有这样的情况」", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0701", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「特别是对结女的学生们」", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0702", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样吗」", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是确实是这样……", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起最初的时候确实与大家亲密了许多，就算再怎么说，也实在没办法和濑名同学，天羽学姐，乾同学一起那样胡闹。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": "比起最初的时候确实与大家亲密了许多，就算再怎么说，也实在没办法和濑名同学，天羽学姐，乾同学一起那样胡闹。", "plain_idx": 508, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为是安洁」", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结论果然是这样。", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟是安洁。果然安洁在结女的学生之中是最平易近人的」", "text_idx": 511, "plain": "「毕竟是安洁。果然安洁在结女的学生之中是最平易近人的」", "plain_idx": 511, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
